   // A REAL LETTER, not a drawing of one. The forge's `tengwa` and `rune` charges build
   // an approximation out of arcs and stems -- a telco with a luva hung on it, made to
   // look about right. That is fine for an ornament and wrong for a NAME: Elendil's
   // badge is his own name written without its vowels, and the Stewards' seal is a word.
   // These are the outlines from arda_scripts.json, whose values were checked against
   // Appendix E, carried in by map/gen_forge_glyphs.py.
   //   {t:"glyph", script:"teng"|"cirth", k:"lambe"|"19", n, size, ox, oy, c}
   // k, size, ox and oy may each be a list, so a word is one course:
   //   {t:"glyph",n:3,k:["lambe","ando","lambe"],ox:[-0.46,0,0.46],size:0.30}
   var GS=(window.ARDA_GLYPH||{})[L.script||"teng"]||{};
